  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Brush the salmon fillets lightly with olive oil.",
    "Season the fillets evenly with sea salt and black pepper.",
    "Place the fillets skin-side down on the grill and cook for 4 minutes until grill marks form.",
    "Flip the fillets and brush both sides generously with Thai chili jam.",
    "Continue grilling for another 3 minutes until the salmon flakes easily and is opaque.",
    "Remove from the grill, squeeze fresh lime juice over the fillets, and sprinkle chopped dill on top.",
    "Plate immediately, serving the salmon hot and juicy."
